@startuml HRMS_Sequence_Attendance
title HRMS - Attendance Processing Sequence

actor Employee
participant "Web / Mobile / Device" as Device
participant "Node.js API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
queue "SQS" as SQS
participant "FastAPI Workforce Engine" as Engine
participant "Attendance Worker" as AW

Employee -> Device: Check in
Device -> API: POST /attendance/checkins
API -> DB: BEGIN
API -> DB: SET LOCAL app.tenant_id
API -> DB: Insert immutable check-in
API -> DB: Insert outbox event
DB --> API: Commit
API --> Device: 202 Accepted

AW -> SQS: Consume CheckinRecorded
SQS --> AW: Event with tenant_id + event_id
AW -> DB: Establish tenant context
AW -> DB: Check processed_event
AW -> Engine: Process attendance job
Engine -> DB: Load shift assignment
Engine -> DB: Load check-ins
Engine -> DB: Load approved leave
Engine -> Engine: Resolve shift
Engine -> Engine: Pair IN/OUT
Engine -> Engine: Calculate hours / late / overtime
Engine -> DB: Write attendance result
Engine -> DB: Mark event processed
Engine -> SQS: Ack

note over Engine,DB
Raw check-ins remain traceable.
Derived attendance can be recalculated.
Duplicate events must be idempotent.
end note

@enduml
